rebel recruiter man~
a rebel recruiter~
This man is trying to find others willingly to fight for freedom.
~
This man is taking a big risk by wandering in the open inside an Imperial
controlled village.  He casually walks up to the citizens and begins to talk,
and from a distance you can make out a few words. Most of them are not very
patriotic.
