#5109
Inside A Half-Troll Longhouse~
This is the private section of the local medicine woman.  There are numerous
odd fetishes and talismans along the wall as well as potions and incense.  The
ground is much more sparse than the other parts of the longhouse, and the
creature comforts are all but removed.
